{
  "_doc": "Casos adversarios (es/en). Cada caso es una conversación (turns) cuyo ÚLTIMO turno se valida con `expect`. Un turno {\"pick_option\": n} reenvía el `value` de la opción n de la aclaración anterior. Además de `expect`, el runner aplica SIEMPRE: números verificados contra el oráculo (unidad y fila), ui_payload == oráculo, respuesta sin Markdown y corta. Campos de expect: intent[], display_type[], tools_include[], tool_status_any[], alerts_any[], ui_parts_include[], ui_all_enclosure, no_ui_actuators, options_between[min,max], answer_any[regex], answer_none[regex], answer_none_unless[[prohibido, aclaracion]] (falla solo si aparece lo prohibido SIN la aclaracion; p. ej. ADV-14: en 24V la ficha trae una sola corriente *_dc_or_fixed_*, citarla junto a '60 Hz' vale si el texto aclara que no hay valores 50/60 Hz separados), must_state[{pn,field}], max_words.",
  "cases": [
    {"id": "ADV-01", "lang": "es", "category": "typo", "turns": ["¿Cuál es el torque del 761800-11300000/A?"],
     "expect": {"tools_include": ["lookup_actuator_by_part_number"], "tool_status_any": ["TYPO_OR_CLOSEST_MATCH_FOUND"], "alerts_any": ["TYPO_OR_CLOSEST_MATCH_FOUND"], "answer_any": ["no (existe|encontr|figura)", "cercan", "parecid", "quiz[aá]s", "quiso decir", "similar", "761[ab]00"]}},
    {"id": "ADV-02", "lang": "en", "category": "typo", "turns": ["Give me the specs of 763B0O-11300000/A"],
     "expect": {"tools_include": ["lookup_actuator_by_part_number"], "tool_status_any": ["TYPO_OR_CLOSEST_MATCH_FOUND", "EXACT_MATCH"], "answer_any": ["763b00-11300000/a"]}},
    {"id": "ADV-03", "lang": "es", "category": "na_3phase", "turns": ["Dame las especificaciones del 761A00-11330C00/A"],
     "expect": {"tool_status_any": ["MODEL_LISTED_AS_NA"], "alerts_any": ["MODEL_LISTED_AS_NA"], "answer_any": ["n/d", "n/a", "no (está )?disponible", "no figura", "no se ofrece", "no existe"], "ui_parts_include": []}},
    {"id": "ADV-04", "lang": "en", "category": "na_3phase", "turns": ["Is the 762B00-11330C00/A available in 220V three phase?"],
     "expect": {"tool_status_any": ["MODEL_LISTED_AS_NA"], "alerts_any": ["MODEL_LISTED_AS_NA"], "answer_any": ["n/a", "not available", "isn't available", "not offered", "listed as"]}},
    {"id": "ADV-05", "lang": "es", "category": "invented_pn", "turns": ["Dame la corriente FLA del 999Z99-00000000/Z"],
     "expect": {"tools_include": ["lookup_actuator_by_part_number"], "tool_status_any": ["INVALID_PART_NUMBER"], "no_ui_actuators": true, "answer_any": ["no (existe|encontr|figura|coincide|es v[aá]lido)", "ning[uú]n actuador", "inv[aá]lido", "formato"]}},
    {"id": "ADV-06", "lang": "en", "category": "invented_pn", "turns": ["What is the torque of actuator 770Q00-12345678/A?"],
     "expect": {"tools_include": ["lookup_actuator_by_part_number"], "tool_status_any": ["INVALID_PART_NUMBER", "TYPO_OR_CLOSEST_MATCH_FOUND"], "answer_any": ["not found", "doesn't exist", "does not exist", "no (series 76 )?actuator", "invalid", "no match", "isn't", "not a valid", "closest", "does not match", "no coincide"]}},
    {"id": "ADV-07", "lang": "es", "category": "ambiguity", "turns": ["Recomiéndame un actuador"],
     "expect": {"intent": ["clarify"], "display_type": ["CLARIFICATION"], "options_between": [2, 4], "no_ui_actuators": true}},
    {"id": "ADV-08", "lang": "en", "category": "ambiguity", "turns": ["I need an actuator for a valve"],
     "expect": {"intent": ["clarify"], "display_type": ["CLARIFICATION"], "options_between": [2, 4], "no_ui_actuators": true}},
    {"id": "ADV-09", "lang": "en", "category": "impossible", "turns": ["Which Series 76 actuator delivers at least 12000 Nm of on/off torque?"],
